<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Chat</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">Web app</span><span class="mono">chat.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">Fast messaging with searchable history and bots.</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">How to sign in</p><p>Choose Sign in on the site.</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://chat.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-chat-web">Open</a></div>
</li><li class="app-card tone-red" data-id="app-scribe-web">
<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3M8 21h8"/></svg></span>
<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Scribe</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">Web app</span><span class="mono">scribe.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">Record audio and turn it into searchable, editable transcripts.</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">How to sign in</p><p>Choose Sign in on the site.</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://scribe.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-scribe-web">Open</a></div>
</li></ul>
</section>
<section class="apps-section" id="how-sign-in-works" aria-labelledby="apps-steps-title" data-id="apps-steps">
<h2 class="apps-section-title" id="apps-steps-title">How sign-in works</h2>
<ol class="apps-steps"><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Pick an app</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Choose Sign in on its site, or run <code class="mono">tunelo login</code> in a terminal.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">Continue with Google or GitHub</h3><p class="apps-step-body">The account you linked signs you in. The first time, you pick a username.</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">You are back in the app</h3><p class="apps-step-body">Apps from outside hoandat, such as AI tools, ask for your approval first.</p></div></li></ol>
</section>
<p class="apps-manage" data-id="apps-manage">To see or remove the apps that can access your account, open <a class="link" href="/account">Account</a>.</p></main>
<footer class="page-foot container"><nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="Language" data-id="lang-switch"><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=en&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="en" hreflang="en" aria-current="true" data-id="lang-en">English</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=zh-CN&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN" data-id="lang-zh-CN">中文</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=vi&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="vi" hreflang="vi" data-id="lang-vi">Tiếng Việt</a></nav></footer>
</body>
</html>"
