<p class="apps-lead">用 Google 或 GitHub 登录一次，即可在下方所有应用中使用同一个账号。</p>
<ul class="apps-trust"><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>使用 Google 或 GitHub 登录</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>无需创建或记住密码</span></li><li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>由你决定哪些应用可以访问</span></li></ul>
<div class="apps-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/account" data-id="apps-manage-account">管理你的账号</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#how-sign-in-works" data-id="apps-how">登录如何进行</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="apps-hero-art"><svg class="hub" viewBox="0 0 544 300" role="img" aria-label="通过 Google 或 GitHub 进入你的 hoandat 账号，即可登录 Localman、Localman MCP、Tunelo CLI、Tunelo、Chat和Scribe。" data-id="apps-hub">
<path class="hub-line" d="M132 110 C164 110 164 150 196 150"/><path class="hub-flow tone-primary" d="M132 110 C164 110 164 150 196 150"/><path class="hub-line" d="M132 190 C164 190 164 150 196 150"/><path class="hub-flow tone-primary" d="M132 190 C164 190 164 150 196 150"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 25 392 25"/><path class="hub-flow tone-violet" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 25 392 25"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 75 392 75"/><path class="hub-flow tone-cyan" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 75 392 75"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 125 392 125"/><path class="hub-flow tone-green" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 125 392 125"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 175 392 175"/><path class="hub-flow tone-amber" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 175 392 175"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 225 392 225"/><path class="hub-flow tone-blue" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 225 392 225"/><path class="hub-line" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 275 392 275"/><path class="hub-flow tone-red" d="M324 150 C358 150 358 275 392 275"/>
<g class="hub-node">
<rect x="8" y="90" width="124" height="40" rx="10"/>
<svg x="20" y="102" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path class="hub-mark" d="M12.48 10.92v3.28h7.84c-.24 1.84-.853 3.187-1.787 4.133-1.147 1.147-2.933 2.4-6.053 2.4-4.827 0-8.6-3.893-8.6-8.72s3.773-8.72 8.6-8.72c2.6 0 4.507 1.027 5.907 2.347l2.307-2.307C18.747 1.44 16.133 0 12.48 0 5.867 0 .307 5.387.307 12s5.56 12 12.173 12c3.573 0 6.267-1.173 8.373-3.36 2.16-2.16 2.84-5.213 2.84-7.667 0-.76-.053-1.467-.173-2.053H12.48z"/></svg>
